   "src": "ps1"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen145.0025",
   "jp": "お前は、もう十分なはずだ。{n}他の者を選ぶが良い。",
   "en": "You should have quite enough already. Choose{n}someone else.",
   "term": "end",
   "src": "ps1"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen145.0026",
   "jp": "４００００エルムだが、どうする？",
   "en": "It costs 40,000 Elm. What say you?",
   "term": "end",
   "src": "ps1"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen145.0027",
   "jp": "では、お前にプレゼントを与えよう！",
   "en": "Then I shall bestow a gift upon you!",
   "term": "end",
   "src": "ps1"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen145.0028",
   "jp": "　{n}{s:FFED}は『{FFEF}盗む３{FFF1}』が修得可能になった！",
   "en": "　{n}{s:FFED} can now learn '{FFEF}Steal 3{FFF1}'!",
   "term": "end",
   "src": "ps1"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen145.0029",
   "jp": "２００００エルムだが、どうする？",
   "en": "It costs 20,000 Elm. What say you?",
   "term": "end",
   "src": "ps1"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen145.0030",
   "jp": "　{n}{s:FFED}は『{FFEF}盗む２{FFF1}』が修得可能になった！",
   "en": "　{n}{s:FFED} can now learn '{FFEF}Steal 2{FFF1}'!",
   "term": "end",
   "src": "ps1"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen145.0031",
   "jp": "ダメだ！　まるでダメダメだ！{n}お金が足りぬではないか！{n}他の者を選ぶが良い。",
   "en": "No good! No good at all! You haven't enough money!{n}Choose someone else.",
   "term": "end",
   "src": "ps1"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen145.0032",
   "jp": "５０００エルムだが、どうする？",
   "en": "It costs 5,000 Elm. What say you?",
   "term": "end",
   "src": "ps1"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen145.0033",
   "jp": "　{n}{s:FFED}は『{FFEF}盗む１{FFF1}』が修得可能になった！",
   "en": "　{n}{s:FFED} can now learn '{FFEF}Steal 1{FFF1}'!",
   "term": "end",
   "src": "ps1"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen145.0034",
   "jp": "ダメだ！{n}まるでダメダメだ！{n}お金が足りぬではないか！",
   "en": "No good! No good at all! You haven't enough money!",
   "term": "end",
   "src": "ps1"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen145.0035",
   "jp": "用があったら声をかけるがよい。",
   "en": "Speak to me if you need anything.",
   "term": "end",
   "src": "ps1"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen145.0036",
   "jp": "{v:0033}いらっしゃいませ。{n}この店では、様々なグッズをお買い求めいただけます。",
   "en": "{v:0033}Welcome. We have a wide variety of goods for sale.",
   "term": "end",
   "src": "ps1"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen145.0037",
   "jp": "{v:0034}本日はお買い求めですか？{n}それともご売却ですか？",
   "en": "{v:0034}Will you be buying or selling today?",
   "term": "end",
   "src": "ps1"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen145.0038",
   "jp": "・購入",
   "en": "・Buy",
   "term": "end",
   "unref": true,
   "src": "ps1"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen145.0039",
   "jp": "・売却",
   "en": "・Sell",
   "term": "end",
   "unref": true,
   "src": "ps1"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen145.0040",
   "jp": "他にも何かおありでしょうか？",
   "en": "Is there anything else I can help you with?",
   "term": "end",
   "src": "ps1"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen145.0041",
   "jp": "・購入",
   "en": "・Buy",
   "term": "end",
   "unref": true,
   "src": "ps1"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen145.0042",
   "jp": "・売却",
   "en": "・Sell",
   "term": "end",
   "unref": true,
   "src": "ps1"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen145.0043",
   "jp": "{v:003E}ありがとうございました！{n}またどうぞ、お越し下さい。",
   "en": "{v:003E}Thank you very much! Please come again.",
   "term": "end",
   "src": "ps1"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen145.0044",
   "jp": "{v:0040}まぁ、いらっしゃい。{n}このお店は、どんなグッズでもそろってるわよ。",
   "en": "{v:0040}Oh, welcome! You'll find all sorts of goods here, dear.",
   "term": "end",
   "src": "ps1"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen145.0045",
   "jp": "{v:0041}それで、買いに来たの？{n}売りに来たの？",
   "en": "{v:0041}So, are you here to buy or to sell?",
   "term": "end",
   "src": "ps1"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen145.0046",
   "jp": "・購入",
   "en": "・Buy",
   "term": "end",
   "unref": true,
   "src": "ps1"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen145.0047",
   "jp": "・売却",
   "en": "・Sell",
   "term": "end",
   "unref": true,
   "src": "ps1"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen145.0048",
   "jp": "で、他にも何かある？",
   "en": "So, anything else?",
   "term": "end",
   "src": "ps1"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen145.0049",
   "jp": "・購入",
   "en": "・Buy",
   "term": "end",
   "unref": true,
   "src": "ps1"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen145.0050",
   "jp": "・売却",
   "en": "・Sell",
   "term": "end",
   "unref": true,
   "src": "ps1"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen145.0051",
   "jp": "{v:004B}また来てよね。{n}素敵な笑顔で待ってるから。",
   "en": "{v:004B}Come back again, won't you? I'll have a lovely smile{n}waiting for you.",
   "term": "end",
   "src": "ps1"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen145.0052",
